  "description": "Integrated vacuum deposition systems for semiconductor thin-film formation: sputter deposition systems (DC and RF magnetron, target assemblies, substrate bias), CVD reactor systems (LPCVD hot-wall tubes, PECVD parallel-plate reactors, APCVD conveyor furnaces), evaporation systems (thermal boat, electron-beam, thickness monitoring), load-lock transfer mechanisms, and pump-down/bake-out procedures for achieving process-ready base pressure. These systems integrate vacuum pumps, chambers, gas handling, and precision motion into process-specific tools.",
